class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. October to November is the driest pair at 5.06 inches normal, and it came in under 90% of normal in 39 years. In 2025 that pair finished at 22% of normal and September to October at 31%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 23% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
